WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.663
Quick question: how much of your day do you
already spend in ChatGPT or Claude?

2
00:00:05.713 --> 00:00:11.117
Probably a lot. So why do you still leave it every time
you want to put something on social media?

3
00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:14.317
Your AI writes the caption in five seconds.

4
00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:21.417
Then you spend the next 20 minutes opening TikTok,
Instagram, LinkedIn and your other social channels.

5
00:00:21.467 --> 00:00:27.254
You're doing the same thing over and over again. The AI did
the easy part, and you're still stuck doing the boring part.

6
00:00:27.304 --> 00:00:32.054
Post Social fixes that. Connect your social accounts once.

7
00:00:32.104 --> 00:00:40.454
Then connect Post Social to the AI you already use:
ChatGPT, Claude, Claude Code, Muse, Grok, whatever you're in.

8
00:00:40.504 --> 00:00:43.023
And no, you don't need to be a developer.

9
00:00:43.073 --> 00:00:51.323
Now watch. I'm in Claude, and I just type: "Post today's
behind-the-scenes clip to TikTok at 6pm."

10
00:00:51.373 --> 00:00:57.550
Done. It wrote the post, picked the channel,
and scheduled it, and I never left the chat.

11
00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:03.207
That's the whole idea. Your AI isn't just helping you write
anymore. It's actually helping you distribute.

12
00:01:03.257 --> 00:01:08.491
If you'd rather see everything laid out,
Post Social also has its own dashboard.

13
00:01:08.541 --> 00:01:15.191
Write it once, preview it on whichever platform you want
to distribute on, and see your whole week on the calendar.

14
00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:21.131
Every post shows who sent it:
Claude, ChatGPT, Codex, or whomever.

15
00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:25.707
That's it for now. I hope you enjoy the product,
and I'll talk to you soon.
